ed-today-in-morgantown</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/10/football-countdown-to-kickoff-offensive-fireworks-expected-today-in-morgantown</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Area coal miners pose for a picture inside a mine shaft ahead of Saturday's Coal Rush game against Arizona to celebrate the state's coal mining heritage." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/9/Mine-Tour.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – It might be a good idea to keep one eye on the Milan Puskar Stadium scoreboard today when West Virginia and Arizona hook up at high noon.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/Mine-Tour.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/Mine-Tour.jpg"><media:title>Area coal miners pose for a picture inside a mine shaft ahead of Saturday's "Coal Rush" game against Arizona to celebrate the state's coal mining heritage.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/Mine-Tour.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 07:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59513</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Fall on the Road to Old Dominion</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/mens-soccer-mountaineers-fall-on-the-road-to-old-dominion</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/mens-soccer-mountaineers-fall-on-the-road-to-old-dominion</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Aurelien Cormier dribbles the ball for WVU Men's Soccer" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/9/MSOC_WVUvsGeorgiaState_Sept18_2026_TT_164_large.jpg" /><br /><br />NORFOLK, Va. – The No. 15 West Virginia University men's soccer team suffered a 2-1 defeat at the hands of Old Dominion, Friday night at the ODU Soccer Complex. The Mountaineers suffer their first loss since the season opener and fall to 5-2-3 overall and 1-1-2 in the Sun Belt while the Monarchs improve to 9-3-0 and 1-3-0 in conference play.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/MSOC_WVUvsGeorgiaState_Sept18_2026_TT_164_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/MSOC_WVUvsGeorgiaState_Sept18_2026_TT_164_large.jpg"><media:title>Aurelien Cormier dribbles the ball for WVU Men's Soccer</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/MSOC_WVUvsGeorgiaState_Sept18_2026_TT_164_large.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:56:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59516</s:story_id></item><item><title>No. 9 West Virginia Wins Nuttycombe Invitational</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/cross-country-no-9-west-virginia-wins-nuttycombe-invitational</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/cross-country-no-9-west-virginia-wins-nuttycombe-invitational</guid><category>Cross Country</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="The Mountaineers pose for a team photo after their Nuttycombe Invitational win" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/9/IMG_4030.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 9 West Virginia University cross country team claimed first place at the Nuttycombe Invitational on Friday, Oct. 9, finishing with 66 points in Madison, Wis.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/IMG_4030.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/IMG_4030.jpg"><media:title>The Mountaineers pose for a team photo after their Nuttycombe Invitational win</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/IMG_4030.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:25:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>10</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59515</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Set to Face Third Ranked Opponent in as Many Weeks</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/volleyball-mountaineers-set-to-face-third-ranked-opponent-in-as-many-weeks</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/volleyball-mountaineers-set-to-face-third-ranked-opponent-in-as-many-weeks</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU huddles before the match against Houston on Oct. 4 inside Hope Coliseum" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/9/VB_vsHouston_Oct4_2026_AM_088.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University volleyball team (9-6, 2-3 Big 12) have another ranked opponent on its hands in No. 17 BYU at 8:30 p.m. ET at George Albert Smith Fieldhouse in Provo, Utah.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/VB_vsHouston_Oct4_2026_AM_088.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/VB_vsHouston_Oct4_2026_AM_088.jpg"><media:title>WVU huddles before the match against Houston on Oct. 4 inside Hope Coliseum</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/VB_vsHouston_Oct4_2026_AM_088.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 9 Oct 2026 12:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59512</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Release 2027 Baseball Schedule</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/mountaineers-release-2027-baseball-schedule</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/9/mountaineers-release-2027-baseball-schedule</guid><category>Baseball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Kendrick Family Ballpark overhead picture" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/9/053126_BSB_WakeForest_NCAAT_GB_131_large.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University Department of Intercollegiate Athletics has announced the 2027 Mountaineer Baseball schedule.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/053126_BSB_WakeForest_NCAAT_GB_131_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/053126_BSB_WakeForest_NCAAT_GB_131_large.jpg"><media:title>Kendrick Family Ballpark overhead picture</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/9/053126_BSB_WakeForest_NCAAT_GB_131_large.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:58:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>1</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59511</s:story_id></item><item><title>Utah Hands West Virginia its First Sweep of the Season</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/volleyball-utah-hands-west-virginia-its-first-sweep-of-the-season</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/volleyball-utah-hands-west-virginia-its-first-sweep-of-the-season</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="WVU huddles before a point while playing at Utah on Oct. 8" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/8/DSC08374.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. - The West Virginia University volleyball team (9-6, 2-3 Big 12) fell to Utah in straight sets on Thursday evening at the Jon M. Huntsman Center. The Utes won by set scores of 25-13, 27-25 and 25-20.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/DSC08374.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/DSC08374.jpg"><media:title>WVU huddles before a point while playing at Utah on Oct. 8</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/DSC08374.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 8 Oct 2026 23:19:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>17</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59510</s:story_id></item><item><title>Nickel and Mountaineer Defense Lead WVU to Top-20 Win Over BYU</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/womens-soccer-nickel-and-mountaineer-defense-lead-wvu-to-top-20-win-over-byu</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/womens-soccer-nickel-and-mountaineer-defense-lead-wvu-to-top-20-win-over-byu</guid><category>Women's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Sophia Nickel and Maya Leoni celebrate after a goal." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/8/VVB02075.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. (Oct. 8, 2026) – Behind a pair of goals from junior forward/defender Sophia Nickel and the defense's third-straight shutout, the No. 16-ranked West Virginia University women's soccer team secured a 2-0 victory over No. 20 BYU at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium in Morgantown on Thursday night.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/VVB02075.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/VVB02075.jpg"><media:title>Sophia Nickel and Maya Leoni celebrate after a goal.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/VVB02075.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 8 Oct 2026 22:57:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>13</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59509</s:story_id></item><item><title>Men’s &amp; Women’s Basketball Select Single-Game and Mini Pack Tickets On Sale to Public Oct. 14</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/mens-basketball-mens-womens-basketball-select-single-game-and-mini-pack-tickets-on-sale-to-public-oct-14</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/8/mens-basketball-mens-womens-basketball-select-single-game-and-mini-pack-tickets-on-sale-to-public-oct-14</guid><category>Men's Basketball, Women's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Hope Coliseum" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/8/10262025_BB_WVUvsWheeling_TT-018669.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Single-game tickets for every WVU women's basketball home game, along with nonconference single-game tickets and Big 12 Conference mini packs for WVU men's basketball, go on sale to the general public beginning Wednesday, Oct. 14.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/8/10262025_BB_WVUvsWheeling_TT-